ves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have a lot of time between the settlements and some of it is eaten by anomalies. Will you be cautious or quick with your scavenging?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818750/extras/350535bfb344355eb5bc440599240915.poster.avif?t=1788188485\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818750/extras/350535bfb344355eb5bc440599240915.webm?t=1788188485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818750/extras/350535bfb344355eb5bc440599240915.mp4?t=1788188485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRADING AND DECEIVING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading is vital and will get you missing items, food, tools. It is a trouble trading trash and broken flashlights though. Use your merchant gambits and keen trader eyes to deceive people, spotting their fouls and making the best trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to trade away your humanity though? Maybe eating canned beans today is better than eating full meal if it means someone will get a proper weapon for defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818750/extras/838dda5457696a169986c448483eb0c8.poster.avif?t=1788188485\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818750/extras/838dda5457696a169986c448483eb0c8.webm?t=1788188485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818750/extras/838dda5457696a169986c448483eb0c8.mp4?t=1788188485\" type=\"video/mp4\">